# GMS's barrier blocks status conditions and recharges; only the passive half
# listed under it is kept here. GMS reaches 40 of each at ten levels; this
# reaches the same over twenty, two a level.
#
# Both levers are useless by design (nothing inflicts a status or has an
# element) and are here so the stats page shows what the SP bought.
#
# None of it reaches the party. GMS's only party clause is a cooldown Dispel
# shortens, and the resistances are for the caster only.
name: "Divine Protection"
description: "Permanently increases Status Resistance and Elemental Resistance."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_PRIEST skill_order: 5 }
max_level: 20
base {
  status_resistance: 2
  elemental_resistance: 0.02
}
per_level {
  status_resistance: 2
  elemental_resistance: 0.02
}
